---@field body? gcp.walletobjects_v1.LocalizedString Body to be displayed on the module. Character limit is 50 and longer strings will be truncated.
---@field viewConstraints? gcp.walletobjects_v1.ModuleViewConstraints Constraints that all must be met for the module to be shown.

